{"speciesId":300,"names":{"fr":"Skitty","es":"Skitty","en":"Skitty","ja":"エネコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SKITTY has the habit of becoming fascinated by moving objects and chasing them around. This POKéMON is known to chase after its own tail and become dizzy."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SKITTY is known to chase around playfully after its own tail. In the wild, this POKéMON lives in holes in the trees of forests. It is very popular as a pet because of its adorable looks."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A SKITTY’s adorably cute behavior makes it highly popular. In battle, it makes its tail puff out. It threatens foes with a sharp growl."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is said to be difficult to earn its trust. However, it is extremely popular for its cute looks and behavior."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is said to be difficult to earn its trust. However, it is extremely popular for its cute looks and behavior."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It’s adorable when it chases its own tail. It’s difficult to earn its trust."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It’s adorable when it chases its own tail. It’s difficult to earn its trust."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il poursuit tout ce qui bouge. On le voit parfois courir en cercle, chassant sa propre queue."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il poursuit tout ce qui bouge. On le voit parfois courir en cercle, chassant sa propre queue."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il poursuit tout ce qui bouge. On le voit parfois courir en cercle, chassant sa propre queue."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No puede evitar ir tras las cosas que se mueven. Hasta corre en círculos persiguiéndose la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"動くものを つい 追ってしまう。 自分の 尻尾を 追いかけて 同じ 場所を グルグル 回る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon très mignon qui aime parfois courir en cercle en chassant sa propre queue."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le gusta jugar persiguiéndose la cola hasta que se marea, mostrando así su lado más mono."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"自分の 尻尾を 追いかけて 遊んでいると 目を 回すといった 可愛らしい 一面を みせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Skitty a pris l’habitude de pourchasser les objets mobiles qui le fascinent. On sait que ce Pokémon court souvent après sa queue, jusqu’à ce qu’il ait la tête qui tourne."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Skitty le encanta mover cosas e ir detrás de ellas. Es de todos sabido que se dedica a ir detrás de su propia cola y que, al final, acaba mareándose."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Skitty has the habit of becoming fascinated by moving objects and chasing them around. This Pokémon is known to chase after its own tail and become dizzy."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"動く ものを 見つけると 夢中に なって 追いかけ回す 習性を 持つ ポケモン。 自分の シッポを 追いかけて 目を 回す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On sait que Skitty court souvent après sa queue. À l’état sauvage, ce Pokémon vit dans les cavités des arbres de la forêt. Il est tellement adorable qu’il a un grand succès comme animal de compagnie."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Skitty es conocido por la costumbre que tiene de juguetear y de intentar pillarse la cola. En estado salvaje, habita en las cavidades de los troncos de los árboles del bosque. Es la mascota de muchos por lo dulce que parece."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Skitty is known to chase around playfully after its own tail. In the wild, this Pokémon lives in holes in the trees of forests. It is very popular as a pet because of its adorable looks."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"自分の シッポを 追いかけ回す ポケモン。 野生は 森の 樹木の 穴で 暮らす。 愛くるしい 顔で ペットとして 大人気。"}],"varieties":[{"id":300,"moves":[{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[5,"level-up",15],[6,"level-up",15],[7,"level-up",15],[8,"level-up",15],[9,"level-up",15],[10,"level-up",15],[11,"level-up",15],[12,"level-up",15],[13,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",15],[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",16],[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",4]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[5,"level-up",39],[6,"level-up",39],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",39],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",39],[9,"level-up",42],[10,"level-up",42],[